Still blocked
-------------
* **Apps did not deploy.** `terraform apply` failed creating
  `databricks_app.ontobricks_dev_app`: `Invalid secret resource neo4j-password:
  Secret with scope ontobricks and key neo4j-password does not exist.`
  `databricks.yml:272` binds scope `ontobricks`, but the workspace has only
  `benoit_cayla` and `ontobricks-secrets` (the latter holding an unrelated
